1
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:52,480
Most of my patrons

2
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,760
have gold

3
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:56,599
but no grace,

4
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,959
or fair faces

5
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,519
but empty purses.

6
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:05,239
You, my love, are a rare treasure

7
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:07,680
