9
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:13,480
Your suitors

10
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,039
are legendary,

11
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:18,120
even the great Baron

12
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,680
Ling Yunfei

13
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,879
is rumored to be captive

14
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,479
to your charms.

15
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,560
There is a grand bounty

16
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,840
on his head.

17
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,319
Had I known him,

18
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,039
I would be shamefully wealthy.

19
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,240
A jewel like you

20
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,919
should not languish

21
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,159
in solitude.

22
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,479
I would build you

23
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:45,719
a gilded tower

24
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,879
and keep you

25
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,280
all to myself.

26
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,680
In truth...

27
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,039
He was fair enough

28
