29
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,639
I would not forget such a man,

30
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:02,000
had I ever met him.

31
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:04,919
Yet,

32
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:06,919
you are

33
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,719
