39
00:03:24,759 --> 00:03:25,439
Who dares enter?

40
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,439
Hal?

41
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,360
Ah, so you two are acquainted?

42
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,759
I believe Xiangning was

43
00:03:44,159 --> 00:03:45,759
promised to me tonight.

44
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,520
Is this how

45
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,120
