46
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,120
The master must have erred.

47
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:55,240
Yet, a lord of your breeding...

48
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:57,039
is impossible

49
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,919
