57
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:19,879
You are misinformed.

58
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,039
I seek no wife.

59
00:04:22,159 --> 00:04:23,600
And my presence here tonight...

60
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,839
