72
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,839
You are

73
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,879
in the flower of youth.

74
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,279
Why bother

75
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,839
