83
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,439
Godsgrain is

84
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:16,199
a rare luxury.

85
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,560
Our stock

86
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,720
is

87
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,040
completely dry.

88
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,600
Do you deem

89
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,319
my purse light?

90
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,199
I shall have

91
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,759
