105
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,879
Forgive the intrusion.

106
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,680
A foolish

107
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,680
mistake

108
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:00,199
by my staff.

109
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,480
Myrrh shall

110
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,319
