122
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,480
Yet

123
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:24,399
our word

124
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,959
must stand.

125
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,720
Xiangning,

126
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,560
to the West Wing.

127
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,199
Let it be.

128
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:38,839
I am not one

129
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:40,360
to force matters.

130
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,600
Hal,

131
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,120
shall we seek our fortunes

132
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,000
elsewhere?

133
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:51,240
Fair lady,

134
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,879
if you favor our house,

135
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,560
no need to hide

136
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,240
in a man's guise.

137
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,720
We serve

138
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,240
women as we do men.

139
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,600
Xiangning shall

140
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:03,720
