142
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:06,519
Splendid.

143
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:19,279
Dashing as ever.

144
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:21,439
A man's attire seems

145
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:22,720
