168
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,800
We shall crush

169
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,839
his conspiracy.

170
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,439
Fear not, Your Majesty.

171
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,480
I shall guard the realm

172
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,480
