201
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,080
Its fare is simple and plain.

202
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,039
Two of your finest.

203
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,279
Heavenly...

204
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,080
Heavenly indeed...

205
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,440
I was speaking of the treat...

206
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,240
As was I...

207
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,720
Hal.

208
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,879
Greetings, Lady Situ.

209
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:15,000
A gentleman's attire

210
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,159
cannot mask Lady Meng's grace.

211
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:18,039
Will you honor my parlor

212
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:20,320
with your presence?

213
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,519
A fine tune.

214
00:12:02,919 --> 00:12:03,960
You two

215
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:06,080
