244
00:12:55,039 --> 00:12:57,159
Played tonight for Lord Meng alone.

245
00:12:57,799 --> 00:12:58,879
I would gladly

246
00:12:58,879 --> 00:12:59,720
bear your burdens, My Lady.

247
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:00,679
If I can be

248
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:01,679
