254
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,879
Their maidens excel at

255
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:14,600
guarding their youth,

256
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,240
yet they seek my counsel on music.

257
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:17,440
They speak of

258
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,919
little else but

259
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,480
their Madam, Liu Ruyan.

260
00:13:21,159 --> 00:13:22,120
She rose from

261
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,360
