292
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,399
and rejuvenates the flesh.

293
00:14:12,399 --> 00:14:13,600
What sets your bath

294
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,279
apart from any

295
00:14:15,519 --> 00:14:16,879
common medicinal bath?

296
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:19,120
It has a rather...

297
00:14:20,159 --> 00:14:21,159
peculiar magic, indeed.

298
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,840
It is brewed from a master's

299
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,080
