00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,919
If she

307
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:50,440
summons the bath again,

308
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,360
pray, let me know.

309
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,120
I shall.

310
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,360
Gratitude.

311
00:14:56,919 --> 00:14:58,240
I shall toast you,

312
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,200
with tea in place of wine.

313
00:15:02,519 --> 00:15:03,600
We are sisters in all but blood.

314
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,720
No need for such courtly grace.

315
00:15:07,519 --> 00:15:09,039
I marvel to see

316
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,240
such affection

317
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:12,639
between you two.

318
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:16,159
She has stood by me

319
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,559
in times of need.

320
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,879
Our hearts beat to

321
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,200
the same rhythm.

322
00:15:22,879 --> 00:15:24,720
If there is total honesty between you two,

323
00:15:24,799 --> 00:15:26,919
it would indeed

324
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,320
be a blessing.

325
00:15:28,799 --> 00:15:30,240
Your words carry

326
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,559
a sharp edge tonight.

327
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,480
Your devotion to her

328
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,279
makes me quite envious.

329
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:37,200
You once swore

330
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,679
I was your muse.

331
00:15:38,679 --> 00:15:39,279
Have I

332
00:15:39,879 --> 00:15:41,440
lost my charm so soon?

333
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,960
A muse with

334
00:15:43,039 --> 00:15:44,039
many admirers, Lady Situ.

335
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:45,200
I am but

336
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,480
a humble spectator.

337
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,960
I merely sought to understand

338
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,320
your sudden bond.

339
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,960
I pledge my heart to her.

340
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,840
My friendship is no shadow play.

341
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,720
How do you swear your heart?

342
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,960
I swear it with my life.

343
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,679
The phantom she described

344
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,279
is Ling Yunfei.

345
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:13,960
Madam Liu is clearly

346
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,120
in league with him.

347
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,039
She

348
00:16:16,039 --> 00:16:17,600
saw through my disguise.

349
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,840
Will she suspect my true purpose?

350
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,639
Let her suspect.

351
00:16:23,159 --> 00:16:24,120
Ling Yunfei

352
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,120
will not retreat.

353
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,639
Though Situ Xue aided us,

354
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,240
do not

355
00:16:29,879 --> 00:16:30,919
lower your guard.

356
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,639
The human heart is a treacherous sea.

357
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,799
You seemed well-acquainted

358
00:16:35,799 --> 00:16:36,840
with her,

359
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,399
yet you begrudge me her friendship?

360
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,159
I hear fire in your voice.

361
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,759
One might think you are jealous.

362
00:16:45,519 --> 00:16:47,200
You flatter yourself.

363
00:16:47,399 --> 00:16:49,759
I crave no man's favor.

364
00:17:08,919 --> 00:17:09,559
Grandmaster,

365
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:11,759
I have set her

366
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,079
upon Ling Yunfei's trail

367
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:14,119
as you decreed.

368
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,480
But will this

369
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:16,680
not hinder our plan

370
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,079
to sow Godsgrain across the realm?

371
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,200
No matter.

372
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:20,960
If Ling Yunfei were

373
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,200
so easily caged,

374
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:24,119
his bones would have rotted long ago.

375
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,759
She would have

376
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,400
hunted him regardless.

377
00:17:27,799 --> 00:17:29,039
Better to use him

378
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:30,519
to buy her trust.

379
00:17:30,799 --> 00:17:31,519
But

380
00:17:32,319 --> 00:17:33,720
if she should succeed...

381
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,480
Excellent!

382
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:35,680
We shall

383
00:17:36,079 --> 00:17:37,799
reap the harvest alone!

384
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,920
While our Thrallbarrow

385
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,079
rises in Skyvale,

386
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,279
Ling Yunfei harbors

387
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:45,680
petty ambitions

388
00:17:46,119 --> 00:17:47,359
to hoard

389
00:17:47,359 --> 00:17:48,319
the Godsgrain's profits.

390
00:17:49,039 --> 00:17:49,839
He has chosen

391
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:51,119
the wrong enemy!

392
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,920
Our armaments

393
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,319
have consumed every last coin.

394
00:17:55,599 --> 00:17:57,319
This was our prize.

395
00:17:57,519 --> 00:17:59,000
How dare he lay claim to it?

396
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,640
Since he bears ill intent,

397
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,920
let Meng Tinghui

398
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:05,200
serve as our executioner!

399
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:06,440
Quite so!

400
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:09,720
A chaotic game serves us well!

401
00:18:10,839 --> 00:18:12,240
Feed Meng on your sweet poison.

402
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,039
At the perfect moment,

403
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:17,000
guide her blade to his throat!

404
00:18:21,039 --> 00:18:23,240
You are bleeding still...

405
00:18:23,759 --> 00:18:24,720
A minor scratch.

406
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:27,960
For a decade,

407
00:18:28,599 --> 00:18:29,759
on every full moon,

408
00:18:30,119 --> 00:18:31,720
you have sacrificed your blood

409
00:18:31,799 --> 00:18:33,160
for Midvale's lost souls.

410
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,599
If your hand

411
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,440
weakens,

412
00:18:37,279 --> 00:18:38,480
their spirits

413
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,319
shall curse my name.

414
00:18:41,039 --> 00:18:41,920
I bleed

415
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,400
to appease

416
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,519
the dead.

417
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,640
Yet...

418
00:18:50,599 --> 00:18:51,480
tonight

419
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:52,839
you have crossed the line.

420
00:18:54,119 --> 00:18:55,200
I cannot

421
00:18:56,079 --> 00:18:57,279
bear to see you suffer...

422
00:18:57,759 --> 00:18:58,839
The Grandmaster's wounds

423
00:18:59,839 --> 00:19:01,119
are not your concern.

424
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,799
I have trespassed...

425
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:07,079
Know your place.

426
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:09,160
Leave me.

427
00:19:43,559 --> 00:19:44,160
Baron.

428
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,519
Sit.

429
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:48,640
Fill your belly.

430
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:51,079
Gratitude.

431
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:55,839
Liu!

432
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:05,200
Woman,

433
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:06,359
did you hunger for me?

434
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,160
So eager that you came to my den?

435
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:09,640
Enough,

436
00:20:09,799 --> 00:20:10,400
be serious.

437
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:13,680
Meng Tinghui came tonight,

438
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:15,400
sniffing around

439
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,640
for

440
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,039
Godsgrain.

441
00:20:22,559 --> 00:20:23,759
Our trade is spreading

442
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,480
across the realm.

443
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,119
She was bound to catch the scent.

444
00:20:29,279 --> 00:20:30,079
We play a game of wits

445
00:20:31,519 --> 00:20:32,559
she cannot win.

446
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,279
But

447
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:37,039
your bounty

448
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:38,680
hangs on every wall.

449
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,079
Your high-born brother

450
00:20:40,319 --> 00:20:41,279
still remains silent.

451
00:20:42,119 --> 00:20:43,319
A wolf in lord's clothing!

452
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:44,759
He plotted to

453
00:20:44,759 --> 00:20:45,720
ruin Meng Tinghui,

454
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,480
yet made you his scapegoat!

455
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:48,519
He has

456
00:20:48,519 --> 00:20:49,359
the heart of a viper!

457
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:50,240
When our

458
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,440
gambling halls

459
00:20:51,599 --> 00:20:52,680
made fortunes,

460
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,400
we snatched those

461
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,680
maiden scholars

462
00:20:55,759 --> 00:20:57,519
to warm the beds of his allies.

463
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:58,599
Now that

464
00:20:58,599 --> 00:21:00,359
gambling is outlawed.

465
00:21:00,559 --> 00:21:01,720
Our wealth is dry,

466
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,519
and he leaves us to rot!

467
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,839
We used to build another man's castle.

468
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,559
Now this Godsgrain

469
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:13,200
is our sovereign power!

470
00:21:15,839 --> 00:21:16,759
I named us

471
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,200
the Tiger Roar

472
00:21:20,519 --> 00:21:21,279
because

473
00:21:21,279 --> 00:21:22,680
the world must

474
00:21:23,799 --> 00:21:25,279
hear our roar!

475
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,240
If Meng Tinghui stands in my path,

476
00:21:28,759 --> 00:21:29,720
she shall swallow

477
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,960
this new poison first!

478
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:36,279
The coin first.

479
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,240
Indeed.

480
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,079
Godsgrain

481
00:21:42,279 --> 00:21:44,000
is a miracle.

482
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,000
We made

483
00:21:46,839 --> 00:21:47,920
mountains of silver in mere days.

484
00:21:48,319 --> 00:21:49,480
Whatever you scheme,

485
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:52,559
I shall stand by your side.

486
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:55,119
Cheers!

487
00:21:58,960 --> 00:21:59,839
Stop this madness!

488
00:22:04,799 --> 00:22:05,480
Behold,

489
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:07,279
the great savior

490
00:22:08,359 --> 00:22:09,480
of the realm!

491
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:11,839
What an honor

492
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,559
for our filthy den!

493
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,319
This scum

494
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,559
has no place in our counsel.

495
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,480
This is the queen of my heart,

496
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:23,279
and that is my sworn brother.

497
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:24,519
If you have words,

498
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:25,680
spit them out now.

499
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:30,000
You sleep with pigs.

500
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,039
You have lost all nobility.

501
00:22:36,359 --> 00:22:37,480
As if

502
00:22:38,359 --> 00:22:39,960
you have any,

503
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:41,559
brother?

504
00:22:44,079 --> 00:22:45,000
You sanctimonious liar.

505
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:46,799
You only thrive

506
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,359
in the dark.

507
00:23:00,359 --> 00:23:01,200
No more of

508
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:02,119
this poison!

509
00:23:02,559 --> 00:23:04,079
Depart the capital by the third night!

510
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:04,960
On whose decree?

511
00:23:05,039 --> 00:23:06,000
They outlawed our gambling dens.

512
00:23:06,559 --> 00:23:07,119
We found

513
00:23:07,119 --> 00:23:08,160
a new well of gold,

514
00:23:08,519 --> 00:23:09,640
and you wish to dry it?

515
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:11,599
You only crave your shares.

516
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:12,920
Fret not,

517
00:23:13,599 --> 00:23:14,599
your tribute

518
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:16,799
shall be paid.

519
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:18,079
You fool!

520
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:19,480
Conspire, rob,

521
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,839
but never kill!

522
00:23:22,519 --> 00:23:23,640
Wealth without slaughter

523
00:23:23,759 --> 00:23:25,000
is the only way to endure!

524
00:23:26,279 --> 00:23:26,880
Listen to

525
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,960
his holy grace!

526
00:23:30,599 --> 00:23:32,160
Who did your butchery

527
00:23:33,119 --> 00:23:34,799
when your hands had to stay clean?

528
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,920
Who went to murder...

529
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:37,519
Silence!

530
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:39,160
Meng's blade is

531
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,599
already at your throat,

532
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:41,960
yet still you tempt fate!

533
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,279
If you are so mighty, My Lord,

534
00:23:44,559 --> 00:23:45,920
why not slay her

535
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,039
yourself?

536
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:48,680
How many times did he

537
00:23:49,599 --> 00:23:51,319
soil his hands to keep yours clean?

538
00:23:51,319 --> 00:23:52,559
A mere whore

539
00:23:53,799 --> 00:23:54,920
dares speak to me!

540
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,680
Should I feed you a dose, brother?

541
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:04,599
It offers a taste of heaven and hell.

542
00:24:05,119 --> 00:24:05,960
You are insane!

543
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:06,680
Aye!

544
00:24:07,279 --> 00:24:08,240
I went mad the day

545
00:24:08,359 --> 00:24:10,000
you made me snatch Yuan Lingyi.

546
00:24:10,279 --> 00:24:11,279
You played the savior,

547
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:11,920
and cast me

548
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,119
into

549
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,880
the dungeons!

550
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,960
Yet I freed you

551
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:16,960
and offered you a new name!

552
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:18,480
Am I to sing your praises?

553
00:24:20,559 --> 00:24:21,319
In this wretched life...

554
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,200
I hold only one sweet memory of you.

555
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,920
Street rat!

556
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,000
Did you think

557
00:24:36,079 --> 00:24:37,400
you could eat our scraps?

558
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,880
I am no rat!

559
00:24:39,039 --> 00:24:40,000
I have a father!

560
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,000
I have a brother!

561
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:41,799
Break his bones!

562
00:24:49,119 --> 00:24:49,880
Lay a hand on him,

563
00:24:50,039 --> 00:24:51,079
and you die!

564
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:59,440
Yunfei, are you well?

565
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,240
It is your brother.

566
00:25:06,519 --> 00:25:07,440
Brother...

567
00:25:08,559 --> 00:25:09,599
If they ever harm you,

568
00:25:10,039 --> 00:25:11,039
come to me.

569
00:25:12,039 --> 00:25:13,039
I shall shield you.

570
00:25:13,759 --> 00:25:15,480
He kept that memory in his heart.

571
00:25:16,319 --> 00:25:17,079
Yet you

572
00:25:17,759 --> 00:25:18,880
turned his love

573
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:21,839
into a leash.

574
00:25:22,759 --> 00:25:23,839
He was

575
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:24,559
your weapon,

576
00:25:24,559 --> 00:25:25,839
your ladder to the high seat.

577
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:27,359
You calculated

578
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,519
his loyalty so well.

579
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:31,319
It is because we are blood

580
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,839
that I forbid you from this madness!

581
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,279
We have been

582
00:25:34,599 --> 00:25:35,359
in perfect accord

583
00:25:35,359 --> 00:25:36,640
for years.

584
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:37,480
Why would...

585
00:25:39,799 --> 00:25:40,680
You wicked witch!

586
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,160
If you truly love him,

587
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,240
make him burn these drugs!

588
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:46,640
Brother,

589
00:25:47,519 --> 00:25:48,720
hear me.

590
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:50,200
Flee this storm!

591
00:25:57,079 --> 00:25:58,039
There is no escape for me.

592
00:25:58,680 --> 00:25:59,680
Nor for you.

593
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:00,680
Lyu Da,

594
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:01,880
show him out.

595
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:02,640
Aye, Baron.

596
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:06,799
My Lord,

597
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:08,799
this way.

598
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,440
I said, move!

599
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,359
Lady Situ

600
00:26:36,599 --> 00:26:37,400
promised word

601
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:39,000
before sundown.

602
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,480
Why has

603
00:26:40,599 --> 00:26:41,799
no messenger arrived?

604
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,920
It is here,

605
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,319
My Lord!

606
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:45,720
The message has arrived.

607
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:52,720
Xiangning says

608
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,039
the next batch

609
00:26:54,039 --> 00:26:55,119
lands in a moon's turn.

610
00:26:55,359 --> 00:26:55,960
Liu Ruyan,

611
