666
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,079
Speak, woman!

667
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,599
Or would you see her murderer walk free?

668
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:17,039
My Lady,

669
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,480
this house is

670
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,880
