686
00:30:45,359 --> 00:30:46,359
Do not let her

687
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:48,039
go to her grave unavenged...

688
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:56,680
Liu Ruyan allied with outlaws

689
00:30:56,759 --> 00:30:57,759
