706
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:44,319
My Lady!

707
00:31:59,839 --> 00:32:00,519
Gods above!

708
00:32:01,359 --> 00:32:02,680
A courtesan with

709
00:32:02,759 --> 00:32:03,279
